### Get all patients
GET http://localhost:5000/api/patients

### Get patient by id
GET http://localhost:5000/api/Patients/3

### Create a new patient
POST http://localhost:5000/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-05-12T00:00:00Z",
  "contactInfo": "john.doe@example.com, +1-555-123-4567",
  "notes": "First consultation scheduled next week.",
  "therapistId": -1
}

### PATCH patient
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/patients/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "FullName": "Updated Name",
  "ContactInfo": "new.email@example.com",
  "Notes": "Updated notes",
  "TherapistId": 2
}

### DELETE patient
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/patients/2